{"id":"chasten_ko","lemma":"частенько","pos":"adv","rank":4313,"glosses":["often"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/07/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Том частенько говорит людям, что я его жена.","en":"Tom often tells people I'm his wife.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"wife"}]},{"text":"Том частенько спит на диване.","en":"Tom often sleeps on the couch.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to sleep","l":"спать"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Раньше я частенько жаловался.","en":"I used to complain a lot.","words":[{"g":"earlier"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to complain, to lament","l":"жаловаться"}]},{"text":"Том частенько поёт фальшиво.","en":"Tom often sings out of tune.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to sing","l":"петь"},null]},{"text":"Мы частенько беседовали за чашкой кофе.","en":"We used to talk over a cup of coffee.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,{"g":"behind / for"},null,{"g":"coffee"}]}]}